[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744583888","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104438#issuecomment-2744583888","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104438","id":2744583888,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jlwbQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T22:26:04Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T22:27:06Z","body":"cc @bruvzg \n\nI'm guessing this is due to one of two possible causes:\n\n- Fontconfig's automatic font detection returns the Thin variant of the font by default if no variant was explicitly required. I've seen this happen a lot on my Linux system after cloning https://github.com/google/fonts to `$HOME/.local/share/fonts`.\n- A variable font is used (perhaps automatically by fontconfig), but its default weight is too thin. We should specify a default weight of `400` (*Regular*) ourselves if a variable font is detected.\n\nAlso, I thought we had CJK fonts bundled in the editor anyway, so these would be prioritized over a custom font: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/tree/master/thirdparty/fonts\n(`DroidSansFallback.woff2` for Chinese, to be specific.)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744583888/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744595179","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104438#issuecomment-2744595179","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104438","id":2744595179,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jlzLr","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T22:34:35Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T22:34:35Z","body":"CJK fonts are bundled with editor and should be prioritized over system fonts, but not a custom font specified in the editor settings. So selecting a wrong custom font might be an issue (editor settings only allow setting font file, not variation or index from a collection), but this should not happen with default config.","author_association":"MEMBER"